name: Erratic Seven Spike — many 7s
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Sevens, a 25% rank spike for Odd Todd,
  Seeing Double setup, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic sevens, many 7s,
  lucky sevens, seven clump, weird rank spike.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Seven
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: OddTodd
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: SeeingDouble
    label: "7-heavy decks make club-7 lines easier if Clubs are available"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Three of a Kind payoff from Seven density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Seven density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
